subproblem.statement:
Assume (TL): for all P, n ∈ ℕ, every open U ⊆ ℝ^P and all Borel sets A ⊆ B ⊆ U with Hⁿ(B ∩ K) < ∞ for every compact K ⊆ U (Hⁿ = μHE[n]), for Hⁿ-a.e. x ∈ A and every linear subspace Q of ℝ^P: B has approximate tangent space Q at x iff A does (HasApproximateTangentSpaceAt, Simon Ch. 3, 1.4).
Let P, n ∈ ℕ, U ⊆ ℝ^P open, RT = (M, θ, ξ) an integer multiplicity triple in U of dimension n+1 (IMRep U (n+1)), and f : ℝ^P → ℝ L-Lipschitz (L ≥ 0). Write T_xM := approxTangentPlane (n+1) M x, γ_{a,b}(s) := min{1, max{0, (b − s)/(b − a)}}, and for g : ℝ^P → ℝ^P and t ∈ ℝ, M_t := M ∩ {g ≠ 0} ∩ f⁻¹(t). Then there is a Borel map g : ℝ^P → ℝ^P with:
(G1) |g(x)| ≤ L for every x;
(G2) g(x) ∈ T_xM for H^{n+1}-a.e. x ∈ M;
(G3) for every Borel φ : ℝ^P → [0, ∞], t ↦ ∫_{M_t} φ dHⁿ is a.e.-measurable on ℝ and ∫_ℝ ∫_{M_t} φ dHⁿ dt = ∫_M |g| φ dH^{n+1};
(G4a) M_t is countably n-rectifiable for every t;
(G4b) for every t such that Hⁿ(M_t ∩ K) < ∞ for every compact K ⊆ U: for Hⁿ-a.e. x ∈ M_t, M_t has approximate tangent space T_xM ∩ g(x)^⊥ (= T_xM ⊓ (ℝ∙g(x))ᗮ) at x;
(G5) for all a < b, every sequence (h_k) of C¹ functions ℝ^P → ℝ with ‖Dh_k(x)‖ ≤ c (all k, x) converging uniformly on ℝ^P to γ_{a,b}∘f, and every Borel W : ℝ^P → ℝ^P with |W| ≤ c', W = 0 outside some compact K ⊆ U, and W(x) ∈ T_xM for H^{n+1}-a.e. x ∈ M:
 ∫_M θ(x) Dh_k(x)[W(x)] dH^{n+1}(x) → ∫_{M∩{a<f<b}} θ(x)·(−(b − a)⁻¹⟨g(x), W(x)⟩) dH^{n+1}(x) as k → ∞.
